  "//": [
    "Real-world corner MINIMUM speeds (km/h) for tools/check/corner-speeds.mjs (#6563 R1a).",
    "Every row cites its source. The values are the 2025 dry pole laps read from OpenF1 car_data",
    "(about 3.7 samples a second, so a real minimum may read a few km/h high), as tabled in the",
    "realism audit #6563. `approx: true` marks a value the audit wrote with a tilde.",
    "`turn` is the game's FIA turn label (Tracks def.turns, __apex.trackInfo corners); `to` makes the",
    "row a span (the minimum over every corner from `turn` through `to`). A merged game corner such",
    "as T12-T13 matches a ref on either number. Speeds compare on the PACE-1 scale (vStd), docs/PHYSICS.md §PACE."
  ],
